| ↳ overlap | 3.6 % | 1.2 % | 1.2 % | 2.9 % |
| overlap rate | 3.5 % | 3.1 % | 1.1 % | 2.7 % |
| merged / slots 11–15 | n/a | n/a | 52.5 % | 60.0 % |
