INSERT INTO plan (id, milestone_id, subject, priority, body, created_at, created_by_task) VALUES (121, 15, 'Modding guide, examples and the store link', 300, 'Part 10 of masterplan 102 (milestone 15: Modding and Steam Workshop). Modders get one guide, `modding/README.md`, that explains everything parts 1–9 built (format, sources and load order, overlay rules, `window.trivia`, mods screen and safe start, publishing, player bundles) plus four example mods that load from `mods/` as is: a bundle, a CSS theme, a rules tweak and a minimal full conversion. The guide ships in the install folder and is linked from the store page and the Workshop page. Runs after parts 1–9 (and 11): it documents their final state, it doesn''t design anything.

## Binding
- decision 134: Modding guide: path, language, examples (recorded by task 909): `modding/README.md`, English only, shipped in the install folder, online at `https://github.com/rubenmoor/trivia/blob/main/modding/README.md`; examples `modding/examples/{theme,rules-tweak,conversion}/`; bundle example = `modding/template-bundle/` (plan 120); examples without media, MIT (decision 107).
