- **Theme** `examples/theme/` (id `example-theme`): root `style.css` only: overrides colour variables from `game/theme.css` and one component rule by its stable class (decision 124), visible on every screen (e.g. a night palette). Shows "add CSS" without copying our files; the guide shows override-by-path (`game/theme.css`) as the other way and why it breaks on updates.
- **Rules tweak** `examples/rules-tweak/` (id `example-rules-tweak`): `entry: "main.js"`: `actions.before` gives every new game one more Soplo (or the closest change the engine accepts as built), `i18n.add` rewords one string in es/en/de so the change is visible, `on("game:end")` logs the result. ≤ 40 lines with comments.
