Done when: `npm run check`, `npm run build` and `check:literals` pass; `trivia` starts; same corner error lines and joker reasons in Spanish as before (spot-check `name_missing`, `joker_spent`, `supply_short`, a Cambiazo reason, and an internal code showing English).', '2026-10-12T00:15:00Z', '2026-10-12T06:02:37Z', 87);
INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task) VALUES (100, 23, 'pseudo-locale xx: generator and dev wiring', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-12, app/client/src/locales/xx.ts (new), app/client/src/lib/i18n.ts (?lang=xx via dev-only dynamic import, async initLang, html lang/numbers stay es, missing-key warn once), app/client/src/main.ts, directory.md; exempt: joker.*.key and flag.key; throw-away check: 195 leaves ok; dist has no xx/pseudo code', 'Part 1 of plan 23 (LUI-2). Precondition: `app/client/src/lib/i18n.ts`, `app/client/src/locales/es.ts` and the `?lang=` dev override from plan 21 exist. If they don''t, drop this task with a note (`pm task drop`) instead of building them here.

- `app/client/src/locales/xx.ts` (new): `pseudo(es): Catalog`, generated at runtime from `es`, no hand-written catalog.
  - Walks every leaf: plain strings, plural maps (`{ one, other, … }`), variant arrays (`copy.*`); same shape, so it satisfies `Catalog`.
  - ASCII letters → look-alikes (`a→å`, `e→é`, `o→ø`, `c→ç`, `n→ñ`, `A→Å`, …).
  - ~40 % extra length (rounded up, min. 2 chars) as `~` runs, inside `[` … `]`.
  - `{param}` placeholders stay byte-for-byte; only text outside `{…}` changes.
  - Small exempt list in `xx.ts`: single-letter joker keys (`joker.<id>.key`), left unchanged.
- `app/client/src/lib/i18n.ts`: picks `xx` only when `import.meta.env.DEV && ?lang=xx`, via dynamic `import()`. `document.documentElement.lang` stays `es` for `xx`.
- Missing keys: keep plan 21''s `⟦key⟧`; add a dev-only `console.warn` once per missing key.
- `directory.md`: add `app/client/src/locales/xx.ts`.

Verify with a throw-away script (delete it afterwards) that runs `pseudo()` over `es`: every leaf changed (except exempt), `{params}` unchanged, length ≥ 1.4× (except exempt), shape equal.

Done when: `npm run check` and `npm run build` pass; no `xx`/`pseudo` code in `app/client/dist/` (grep the build); `es` output unchanged.', '2026-10-12T00:15:27Z', '2026-10-12T21:29:54Z', 88);
INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task) VALUES (101, 23, 'pseudo-locale xx: screen walk, missed literals, overflow rows', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-12, app/client/src/locales/xx.ts (exempt *Key shortcuts: newKey/replayKey were pseudo''d, N did nothing under xx), plans/backlog.md (B-17, B-18), plans/15a-ui-translation.md, plans/project.md; screen walk under ?lang=xx at 1920x1080 + 1280x1024 (language, start incl. resume and save notice, player list/delete, level incl. milestones and ''again'', select incl. fresh badge, question with every joker armed/used, tray reasons, hints, final answer, correct, wrong, victory, overlay, reports, corner error): no missed literals; only content, endonyms, credits and English internal fallbacks (HTTP 500) stay plain; follow-up task 493 (missing() recursion); dev warning seen: LanguageScreen bind:this non-reactive (pre-existing)', 'Part 2 of plan 23 (LUI-2). Needs task "pseudo-locale xx: generator and dev wiring" done, and the screenshot method from plan 21 (decision 6).

- Run `npm run dev -w app/client` + `trivia`, open with `?lang=xx`, TV layout 1920 × 1080 (`theme.css`). Screens: start, player, level, select (every joker tray state incl. reasons), question (every joker armed and used, hints, final answer), result, victory, overlay, error line in the corner.
