INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task) VALUES (143, 32, 'Recorded whooshes, pops, menu blips, desbloqueado, hola', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-13, app/client/src/game/sound.svelte.ts (SAMPLE_NAMES/SAMPLE_FOR, pop rate 0.9–1.15), app/client/public/audio/{whoosh,swoosh-sube,escoba,pop,menu-abre,menu-cierra,desbloqueado,hola}.m4a (44 kB total, mono AAC 80k, ~-16 LUFS capped at -1.5 dBTP), CREDITS.md rows. All 8 cues now recorded, none kept synthesized: whoosh/swoosh-up/pop from Freesound CC0 (qubodup, SlavicMagic reversed whoosh, unfa); swoosh (Paso) = first stroke of semccab''s broom sweep (quiet source, +20 dB, check it first); menu-open/close, unlocked, ready = Kenney Interface Sounds maximize_001/minimize_001/glass_001/confirmation_001. Picked by spectrogram, not by ear: the A/B listening in /?efectos is for task 146.', 'Replace the synthesized UI effects with CC0 recordings (plan 32 "Sources", "Pipeline", "Wiring").

