INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task) VALUES (232, 47, 'Licence fields in the export and the credits generator (PUB-5)', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-12, authoring/tools/pool_export.py (licence fields), app/data/pool.json (re-export), app/client/credits.ts (Vite plugin: dist/credits.json + dist/CREDITS.md, dev /credits.json; fails on missing license/source_url, warns GFDL), app/client/node.d.ts (Node types without @types/node), tsconfig.json, vite.config.ts, directory.md, plans/18 (shell entry line). 1102 distinct media, 13 sounds, fonts, glyphs, Svelte MIT text; no Game section (no LICENSE yet). Checks: npm run check/test/build, qgen validate, nix build .#app has CREDITS.md; temp pool without license fails. Data locale-neutral (decision recorded). Follow-up task 621: Electron entry.', 'Part 1 of plan 47 ("Data for the generator", "Generator: a Vite plugin"). Build-time credits from `app/data/pool.json` plus fixed lists; no screen yet.

