Binding: decision 111: Steam only (no "without Steam", "clean machine without Node/Python", "Linux without Nix" or "network off before install" rows; no "browser game keeps working" check); decision 125: Steam Deck: best effort, review without a Deck at hand (no real-Deck rows; Deck-sized = Linux build in a 1280×800 window); decision 126: Image peek: which pad button and key? (R3, glyph RS / R3; key `V` per catalog); decision 39: Local builds start offline? (start test skipped, lives in the Steam beta test, task 263; not linked or re-added here); decision 14: CI builds (SW-6) (SW-6 is S5); decision 70: overlay is S5, not in this checklist.

