- Run what a worker can and note it in the intro: artefacts from one commit (`trivia-desktop-build`), `qgen validate` clean, `trivia-media sync --status approved` before the build, `CREDITS.md` in the artefact. A failure here: note it, `pm task add` in the owning plan, stop without the decision.
- `did=$(pm decision add "S3 test passed?" --body - --option "passed" --option "passed with minor issues (list them; they go to the backlog)" --option "failed (list the failing rows)")`, body: the whole checklist (platform tables as Markdown, build commit, artefact names, how to start the 1280×800 window) and how to report (copy the tables, fill result and note; "skipped" needs a reason).
