Done when (throw-away check, temp `TRIVIA_STATE`, hand-written `game.json`): start-page players and supply per player; `qgen report --player` with casefold «Íngrid»; unknown player → "unknown player"; `apply_flags` makes a review once, a second start skips it, a reflag (new `flagged_on`) applies again; `game.json` byte-identical afterwards. Same checks without `game.json` show today''s behaviour unchanged. `qgen validate` passes.', '2026-10-12T03:27:24Z', '2026-10-12T04:29:29Z', 289);
