Then `pm decision add "Steam binding for the Electron shell?"`, recommended option first, body ultra-short (key facts, links). Add a follow-up task in plan 54, `pm task-pending-decision` on it: record the answer in D-63 (consequences line, `plans/decisions.md`) and plan 18 (SW-2 note, SW-8 wording). Done when the decision and the pending follow-up task exist.', '2026-10-12T03:38:13Z', '2026-10-12T14:42:47Z', 313);
