Checks: `npm run check`, `npm run build`, `check:literals`; in the browser (or the desktop shell) with a temp `TRIVIA_STATE` holding a crafted save: k ≥ K shows nothing, k < K the warning with the right range, k = 0 the repeat line, an exhausted subcategory once and not on the next start. Never write `state/`.', '2026-10-12T18:27:24Z', '2026-10-12T18:27:31Z', 418);
INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task) VALUES (425, 65, 'Authoring on save v3: save_file, qgen report, start page', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-12, authoring/tools/save_file.py, authoring/tools/qgen.py, authoring/server/overview.py, authoring/ui/src/home/Home.svelte, authoring/ui/src/lib/types.ts, plans/backlog.md (B-14 for task 300), plans/02, 08, project.md', 'Authoring reads the save (`authoring/tools/save_file.py`, D-59) and still assumes `burned`. Move it to v3 (plan 65).

