- Print the engine''s `k` (supply outlook task) for a fresh profile per cell as a cross-check next to the simulated number.
- `--json` keys updated; D-75 multipliers unchanged.

Checks: `qgen report --simulate --seeds 2` runs for all cells; the fresh-profile `k` and the simulated games until first repeat are in the same ballpark (note the numbers in the done note).', '2026-10-12T18:27:24Z', '2026-10-12T19:11:32Z', 418);
INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task) VALUES (427, 65, 'Plan 65 close-out: full check on a copy of the family save', 'work', 'done', 385, '2026-10-12, no file changes. Temp copy of state/game.json (v2: 44 burns, 4 blocked) via trivia (TRIVIA_STATE) + engine API under node: parseSave → v3 (40 seen, max count 2, counts = v2 burns), PUT /api/save 200 and re-reads as v3, 3 answers +3 seen rows (no repeats), undo drops exactly its row, Bloquear → blocked without seen row, Saltar → seen row, Borrar jugador keeps seen rows (game_id 0). trivia-desktop on temp TRIVIA_SAVE_DIR (keys/CDP): v2 loads, v3 written at game start, answer/undo/Bloquear/Borrar jugador same results. outlook(): k=15, exhausted Animales de Colombia + Platos típicos colombianos (single seen question each, correct); start screen doesn''t show it yet: task 623. grep burned: only v2 upgrade (save.ts, save_file.py), migrate() and test fixtures/history. directory.md already lists outlook.ts. npm run check, npm test (156), npm run build, qgen validate pass; state/ unchanged (sha256).', 'Last task of plan 65.

