Done when: on a worktree with a fake `work/tr-en-1/` (`run.json`, `recorded.json`, an audit file) and a throw-away `questions.en.json`, `/review?batch=tr-en-1&locale=en&sample=1` is blind and records into `spot-checks.json` with `locale`; `qgen validate` clean; Spanish spot checks unchanged. Worktree discarded.', '2026-10-12T19:34:44Z', '2026-10-13T00:43:11Z', 442);
INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task) VALUES (446, 67, 'Stats and start page per locale', 'work', 'done', 390, '2026-10-12, authoring/server/{main,overview}.py, authoring/ui/src/{home/Home.svelte,lib/{api,types}.ts,stats/{Stats,CategoryChart,SubcategoryTable,SparseList,DifficultyChart}.svelte,stats/breakdown.ts}', 'Plan 67, task 4 (QT-4). Files: `authoring/server/main.py` (stats routes), `overview.py`, `authoring/ui/src/home/Home.svelte`, the stats pages in `authoring/ui/src/`.

- `/stats/*?locale=<l>` (with `bundle`): approved, playing translations (`translations.plays`) with their own difficulty; categories/subcategories by the source, labelled with the locale''s names; targets as for Spanish (whether a translated pool counts toward the 5000 is part 9/12, plan 63). Locale switch next to the bundle switch.
