    - Owner: `plans/15c-regional-questions.md` (superseded by bundles, D-39) and `plans/22-bundles.md`. RG-3 is BN-6 (plan 27, milestone 5) plus part 1''s `--bundles`; RG-4 is `qgen batch --bundle` (BN-11, done): mark them so.
